<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTTISH F.A. CUP QUARTER-FINAL DRAW.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTTISH F.A. CUP QUARTER-FINAL DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the quarter-finals of</p>
<p>the Scottish F.A. Cup made late on Saturday:</p>
<p> Hibernian or Celtic	 v Rangers</p>
<p> Falkirk			 v Raith</p>
<p> Hearts or Dundee United   v Motherwell or Hamilton</p>
<p>Greenock Morton or Dundee v Kilmarnock</p>
<p>Matches to be played on March 8 or 9.</p>
</text>
